[2026-05-31T15:52:12.220078] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Complete - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Complete Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'license_generator.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 25, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 25, 'total_lines': 25, 'snippet': '"""\nThis module generates license files for various open-source licenses.\n"""\nimport os\n\nclass LicenseGenerator:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.licenses = {\n            \'MIT\': \'MIT License text...\',\n            \'Apache-2.0\': \'Apache License 2.0 text...\',\n            \'GPL-3.0\': \'GNU General Public License v3.0 text...\',\n        }\n\n    def generate_license(self, license_type: str) -> str:\n        """\n        Generate the license text based on the license type.\n        """\n        return self.licenses.get(license_type, "License type not supported.")\n\n    def save_license(self, license_text: str, file_name: str) -> None:\n        """\n        Save the generated license text to a file.\n        """\n        with open(file_name, \'w\') as file:\n            file.write(license_text)\n', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 786, 'modified_ts': 1780235526.1548004, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1101, 'arguments': {'path': 'license_generator.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.011705398559570312
