e Generated File**:\n   Check the output directory for the generated license file and ensure it meets your project’s requirements.\n\n## Conclusion\nThe Lice project streamlines the process of generating license files, making it easier for developers to comply with open-source license requirements. For further assistance, refer to the documentation or seek help from the community.', 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
